## 📊 Performance

- **Compression Ratio**: Typically 20-60% of original length
- **Speed**: ~1-3 seconds per compression (depends on LLM)
- **Quality**: Maintains semantic meaning and key information
- **Accuracy**: Respects target length constraints (±5%)

